{
    "name": "Demo Shopify - Abandoned Cart",
    "type": "automation",
    "flow": {
        "e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001": {
            "type": "appmixer.shopify.checkouts.AbandonedCart",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 300,
            "source": {},
            "config": {
                "properties": {}
            }
        },
        "e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.email.SendEmail",
            "x": 272,
            "y": 300,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001": [
                        "checkout"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001": {
                            "checkout": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "a": {
                                        "variable": "$.e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.checkout",
                                        "functions": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "g_jsonPath",
                                                "params": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "$.email"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "b": {
                                        "variable": "$.e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.checkout",
                                        "functions": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "g_jsonPath",
                                                "params": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "$.abandoned_checkout_url"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "c": {
                                        "variable": "$.e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.checkout",
                                        "functions": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "g_jsonPath",
                                                "params": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "$.total_price"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "d": {
                                        "variable": "$.e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.checkout",
                                        "functions": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "g_jsonPath",
                                                "params": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "$.currency"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "e": {
                                        "variable": "$.e3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.checkout",
                                        "functions": [
                                            {
                                                "name": "g_jsonPath",
                                                "params": [
                                                    {
                                                        "value": "$.id"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "to": "{{{a}}}",
                                    "subject": "You left something in your cart 🛒",
                                    "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;color:#222\"><h2 style=\"color:#5E8E3E\">Still thinking it over?</h2><p>We saved your cart. Complete your purchase whenever you're ready.</p><p><b>Cart total:</b> {{{c}}} {{{d}}}</p><p><a href=\"{{{b}}}\" style=\"background:#5E8E3E;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px\">Return to checkout</a></p><p style=\"color:#888;font-size:12px\">Checkout reference: {{{e}}}</p></div>"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "wizard": {
        "fields": []
    },
    "notes": {
        "22222222-de30-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "content": "## How to verify this trigger\n\nAbandoned checkouts cannot be created through the Admin API — only a real storefront session creates one:\n\n1. Open the online store in an **incognito window** (https://<store>.myshopify.com; dev stores are password-protected — password is in Online Store → Preferences). A fresh window is required, otherwise Shopify resumes your previous checkout instead of creating a new one.\n2. Add a product to the cart and proceed to checkout.\n3. Enter an **email address and shipping address** and continue to the payment step (without contact info the checkout never appears in the abandoned list).\n4. Close the tab before paying.\n\nShopify lists the checkout in Admin → Orders → Abandoned checkouts (and in the API this trigger polls) after a delay of **~10 minutes**. The flow must already be running at that moment — the trigger baselines existing checkouts on its first poll and only emits checkouts that appear while it runs.",
            "height": 360,
            "width": 380,
            "x": 64,
            "y": -80
        }
    }
}